      "name": "主按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "发起当前流程的主要动作；保留确认和禁用条件。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\" type=\"button\">切换实例</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 17px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;background:var(--accent,#5848c7);color:var(--surface,#ffffff);}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--accent-hover,#4737b0);}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-primary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-primary:active{background:#382a95;}.ds-primary:disabled{background:#e5e3f0;color:#777389;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "次按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "预览、取消或导出等次要动作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\" type=\"button\">预览切换过程</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 17px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;background:var(--surface,#ffffff);color:var(--ink,#202238);border-color:#dddfe9;}.ds-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:#bcb5e2;background:#f9f8ff;}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-secondary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-secondary:disabled{color:#858698;background:#f6f6f9;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "轻按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-quiet",
      "description": "返回、刷新和收起等低层级动作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-quiet\" type=\"button\">返回选择</button>",
      "css": ".ds-quiet{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 17px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;color:var(--muted,#65697e);background:transparent;padding:8px;}.ds-quiet:hover:not(:disabled){background:#eeedf6;color:var(--ink,#202238);}.ds-quiet:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-quiet:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-quiet:disabled{opacity:.5;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quiet{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "文字按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "在当前内容中打开详情或执行轻量动作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text\" type=\"button\">查看备份详情</button>",
      "css": ".ds-text{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 17px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;color:var(--accent,#5848c7);background:transparent;padding:4px 0;border-radius:3px;}.ds-text:hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent-hover,#4737b0);text-decoration:underline;}.ds-text:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-text:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-text:disabled{color:var(--muted,#65697e);opacity:.65;text-decoration:none;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "图标按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "紧凑的详情入口必须保留可访问名称。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看实例详情\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 17px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;color:var(--muted,#65697e);background:transparent;border-color:var(--line,#e6e7ef);padding:8px;}.ds-icon-button:hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#5848c7);background:var(--accent-soft,#f0edff);}.ds-icon-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-icon-button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-icon-button:disabled{opacity:.4;}.ds-icon{width:17px;height:17px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-icon-button{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "文字输入",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "完整标签和占位说明分开，沿用原生文本输入。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">显示名称<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"例如：备用 VPS\" maxlength=\"80\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:block;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#202238);}.ds-input{display:block;width:100%;margin:8px 0 0;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #d6d8e4;border-radius:8px;min-height:42px;background:var(--surface,#ffffff);color:var(--ink,#202238);font:inherit;caret-color:var(--accent,#5848c7);}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#65697e);}.ds-input:hover{border-color:#a9a5bd;}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "顶部导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "当前页面用浅紫底和 aria-current 表达；窄屏保留全部入口。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#overview\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>总览</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#switch\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h15m-4-4 4 4-4 4M20 17H5m4-4-4 4 4 4\"/></svg><span>切换实例</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#tools\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h8m4 0h4M4 12h2m4 0h10M4 18h11m4 0h1\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg><span>运维工具</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:6px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted,#65697e);transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms;}.ds-nav-link:hover{color:var(--accent,#5848c7);background:#f8f7ff;}.ds-nav-link[aria-current]{color:var(--accent,#5848c7);background:var(--accent-soft,#f0edff);}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9f94e9;outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{width:100%;}.ds-nav-link{flex:1;justify-content:center;padding:9px 12px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-link{transition:none;}}.ds-nav-icon{width:17px;height:17px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "状态章",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-good",
      "description": "点、文本和浅底共同表示已确认状态。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">正在服务</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:5px;padding:4px 8px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--green,#187452);background:var(--green-bg,#eaf6ee);}.ds-badge::before{content:\"\";width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "内容面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "白色细边框容器承载一个任务区，静态时无阴影。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-title\">选择目标实例</h2><p class=\"ds-panel-description\">先选择接管服务的实例。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e6e7ef);border-radius:var(--radius,14px);background:var(--surface,#ffffff);color:var(--ink,#202238);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;}.ds-panel-title{font-family:\"Matrix Admin Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.015em;}.ds-panel-description{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#65697e);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;}@media(max-width:460px){.ds-panel{padding:22px 20px;}.ds-panel-title{font-size:17px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "服务归属标记",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "ownership-marker",
      "description": "固定拓扑中的归属索引；位置由观测状态更新，此预览为静态源实例状态。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-ownership\" data-owner=\"source\"><span class=\"ds-owner-label\">服务归属</span><div class=\"ds-owner-lane\"><div class=\"ds-owner-marker\"><svg class=\"ds-owner-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"9\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"m11 12 8 8m-3-3 3-3m-6 0 3-3\"/></svg><span>源实例持有归属</span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-ownership{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e6e7ef);padding-bottom:14px;}.ds-owner-label{display:block;color:var(--muted,#65697e);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px;}.ds-owner-lane{height:33px;}.ds-owner-marker{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;width:33.333%;height:33px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--accent,#5848c7);background:var(--accent-soft,#f0edff);transition:transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),background-color 180ms,color 180ms;}.ds-owner-icon{width:17px;height:17px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-ownership[data-owner=\"target\"] .ds-owner-marker{transform:translateX(200%);}.ds-ownership[data-owner=\"none\"] .ds-owner-marker,.ds-ownership[data-owner=\"unknown\"] .ds-owner-marker{transform:translateX(100%);color:var(--muted,#65697e);background:#edf1f3;}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-owner-lane{height:31px;}.ds-owner-marker{width:100%;height:31px;}.ds-ownership[data-owner] .ds-owner-marker{transform:none;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-owner-marker{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "当代目录索引",
    "overview": "冷纸色画布承托白色记录面板，靛紫标记当前选择与主要动作。界面通过清楚的中文名称、稳定的对齐和适中的记录密度建立秩序；目录感来自索引关系，不模拟纸张材质。\n\n状态说明优先于装饰。服务归属、恢复证据和可用动作保持可见，技术记录按需展开；动画只解释观测到的交接阶段。实际布局见 `.impeccable/surfaces/console.md`，产品与操作约束见 `PRODUCT.md`。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "冷纸色、白色表面与靛紫选中态。",
      "名称与 IP 可直接辨认，记录行保持稳定对齐。",
      "语义状态同时使用文字与颜色。",
      "固定交接拓扑与渐进展开的技术详情。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Color Rule",
        "body": "语义色必须对应已知状态，并配合明确文字；报告过期不能被画成已停止，指令提交不能被画成已完成。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Identity Rule",
        "body": "首先展示名称和 IP，较长名称允许换行；内部标识与完整协议记录放在详情中。",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保持主要操作、状态文字和机器身份清楚可见。",
      "Do 沿用语义色、真实报告和明确的未知状态。",
      "Do 用抽屉与折叠详情承载完整技术记录。",
      "Do 保留原生焦点、键盘操作、确认门槛和减少动效支持。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 用动画、百分比或绿色成功态补全尚未证实的进度。",
      "Don't 把每条机器记录或运维动作重新包装成独立大卡片。",
      "Don't 为演示增加不存在的历史、指标、管理能力或真实部署标识。",
      "Don't 让轮询重建交接场景或重启动画序列。"
    ]
  }
}
